z\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Harness the power of neuropsychology and Psych-K® to break free from self-sabotage, release past trauma, and unlock your fullest potential.\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\"/><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\"/><script/><script/></head><body class=\"min-h-dvh bg-cream font-body text-ink antialiased\"><div data-portal=\"public\" class=\"flex min-h-dvh flex-col bg-canvas text-ink\"><header class=\"sticky top-0 z-50 border-b border-line bg-canvas/85 backdrop-blur\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex h-20 max-w-6xl items-center justify-between px-5 md:px-8\"><a aria-label=\"Valentina Vélez\" href=\"/\"><img src=\"/valentina-logo.png\" alt=\"Valentina Vélez\" class=\"h-14 w-auto shrink-0\" width=\"352\" height=\"220\"/></a><nav class=\"flex items-center gap-5 text-sm\"><a class=\"hidden font-medium text-ink hover:text-wine sm:inline\" href=\"/book\">Book a call</a><a class=\"rounded-pill border border-mocha px-4 py-1.5 font-medium text-wine transition-colors hover:bg-blush\" href=\"/login\">Log in</a></nav></div></header><div class=\"flex-1\"><main><section class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-canvas to-blush/40 px-5 pb-24 pt-20 text-center md:px-8 md:pt-28\"><img src=\"/brain-motif.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute right-[3%] top-1/2 z-0 hidden w-[440px] max-w-[38%] -translate-y-1/2 opacity-[0.22] md:block\" loading=\"eager\"/><div class=\"relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-5xl\"><p class=\"text-eyebrow font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-mocha\">Neuropsychology Specialist &amp; Psych-K® Consultant</p><h1 class=\"mx-auto mt-6 max-w-[15ch] font-headline text-[2.5rem] font-medium leading-[1.08] text-ink-strong md:text-[4.25rem]\">Rewrite your subconscious, <em class=\"italic text-wine\">transform your life.</em></h1><p class=\"mx-auto mt-7 max-w-[52ch] text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink md:text-xl\">Harness the power of neuropsychology and Psych-K® to break free from self-sabotage, release past trauma, and unlock your fullest potential.</p><div class=\"mt-9\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-pill px-7 py-3.5 text-[15px] font-semibold shadow-soft transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 bg-wine text-white hover:bg-wine-dark focus-visible:outline-wine\" href=\"/book\">Book a free discovery call</a></div><p class=\"mt-4 font-headline text-sm italic text-whisper\">A relaxed, no-pressure conversation — no commitment.</p></div></section><section class=\"bg-surface px-5 py-20 md:px-8 md:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-5xl items-center gap-10 md:grid-cols-[0.85fr_1.15fr] md:gap-14\"><div class=\"mx-auto aspect-[4/5] w-full max-w-[340px] overflow-hidden rounded-[20px] bg-gradient-to-br from-blush to-mocha/30 shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(88,12,34,0.12)] md:mx-0\"><img src=\"/valentina-portrait.jpg\" alt=\"Valentina Vélez, Neuropsychology Specialist &amp; Psych-K® Consultant\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover\" width=\"800\" height=\"1000\"/></div><div><p class=\"text-eyebrow font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-mocha\">Meet Valentina</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 font-headline text-3xl font-medium text-ink-strong md:text-4xl\">A neuropsychology specialist for lasting change</h2><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-col gap-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink\"><p>I&#x27;m a Neuropsychology Specialist committed to helping you shift deep-rooted beliefs and patterns at the subconscious level.</p><p>I blend cutting-edge neuroscience with the power of Psych-K® to help you reprogram self-sabotaging behaviors, heal from past trauma, and experience sustainable, life-changing results.</p></div><span class=\"mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-pill bg-blush px-4 py-2 text-[13px] font-medium text-wine\">✦ <!-- -->Certified Psych-K® Facilitator · Florida</span></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-gradient-to-b from-wine to-wine-dark px-5 py-24 text-cream md:px-8 md:py-28\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center\"><p class=\"text-eyebrow font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-mocha\">The path</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 font-headline text-3xl font-medium text-white md:text-[2.6rem]\">A three-phase program</h2><p class=\"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-cream/90\">Change that holds isn&#x27;t a single breakthrough — it&#x27;s a path. We walk it together, from the first pressing challenge to a rhythm you can keep on your own.</p></div><ol class=\"mt-14 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3\"><li class=\"rounded-[20px] bg-surface p-8 text-ink shadow-[0_16px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.18)] transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1.5\"><span class=\"font-headline text-[2.75rem] font-medium leading-none text-mocha\">0<!-- -->1</span><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-headline text-xl font-semibold text-ink-strong\">Acute Phase</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-wine\">Immediate transformation</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate\">We tackle what&#x27;s most pressing right now through focused, dynamic interventions — real movement where you need it first.</p></li><li class=\"rounded-[20px] bg-surface p-8 text-ink shadow-[0_16px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.18)] transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1.5\"><span class=\"font-headline text-[2.75rem] font-medium leading-none text-mocha\">0<!-- -->2</span><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-headline text-xl font-semibold text-ink-strong\">Transition Phase</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-wine\">Building resilience &amp; independence</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate\">You learn self-management techniques and carry more of the work yourself, so the change becomes yours to sustain.</p></li><li class=\"rounded-[20px] bg-surface p-8 text-ink shadow-[0_16px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.18)] transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1.5\"><span class=\"font-headline text-[2.75rem] font-medium leading-none text-mocha\">0<!-- -->3</span><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-headline text-xl font-semibold text-ink-strong\">Maintenance Phase</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-wine\">Sustaining long-term change</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate\">Periodic tune-ups keep the new patterns steady as life keeps moving — support that meets you at the pace you need.</p></li></ol></div></section><section class=\"bg-canvas px-5 py-20 md:px-8 md:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl\"><div class=\"text-center\"><p class=\"text-eyebrow font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-mocha\">How it works</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 font-headline text-3xl font-medium text-ink-strong md:text-4xl\">The core process</h2></div><ul class=\"mt-10 flex flex-col divide-y divide-line\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-6 py-7\"><span class=\"flex h-[52px] w-[52px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-wine font-headline text-2xl text-white shadow-[0_6px_18px_rgba(88,12,34,0.25)]\">1</span><div><h3 class=\"font-headline text-xl font-semibold text-ink-strong\">Awareness &amp; assessment</h3><p class=\"mt-1.5 leading-relaxed text-ink\">We name what&#x27;s really running underneath — the beliefs and patterns beneath the surface.</p></div></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-6 py-7\"><span class=\"flex h-[52px] w-[52px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-wine font-headline text-2xl text-white shadow-[0_6px_18px_rgba(88,12,34,0.25)]\">2</span><div><h3 class=\"font-headline text-xl font-semibold text-ink-strong\">Subconscious reprogramming</h3><p class=\"mt-1.5 leading-relaxed text-ink\">Using Psych-K®, we shift those beliefs at the level where they actually live.</p></div></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-6 py-7\"><span class=\"flex h-[52px] w-[52px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-wine font-headline text-2xl text-white shadow-[0_6px_18px_rgba(88,12,34,0.25)]\">3</span><div><h3 class=\"font-headline text-xl font-semibold text-ink-strong\">Integration &amp; elevation</h3><p class=\"mt-1.5 leading-relaxed text-ink\">The new patterns settle into daily life, and you rise into what they make possible.</p></div></li></ul></div></section><section class=\"bg-gradient-to-b from-blush to-blush/60 px-5 py-20 md:px-8 md:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl\"><div class=\"text-center\"><p class=\"text-eyebrow font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-mocha\">In their words</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 font-headline text-3xl font-medium text-ink-strong md:text-4xl\">Change that held</h2></div><div class=\"mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2\"><figure class=\"relative rounded-[20px] bg-surface p-8 shadow-[0_10px_34px_rgba(88,12,34,0.08)]\"><span class=\"absolute left-6 top-4 font-headline text-6xl leading-none text-mocha/40\">“</span><blockquote class=\"relative mt-6 font-headline text-lg italic leading-relaxed text-ink-strong\">Valentina gave me practical tools and a clear roadmap — I finally understood what to do, not just what was wrong.</blockquote><figcaption class=\"mt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-wine\">Alex H.<!-- --> <span class=\"font-normal text-whisper\">· <!-- -->Florida</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"relative rounded-[20px] bg-surface p-8 shadow-[0_10px_34px_rgba(88,12,34,0.08)]\"><span class=\"absolute left-6 top-4 font-headline text-6xl leading-none text-mocha/40\">“</span><blockquote class=\"relative mt-6 font-headline text-lg italic leading-relaxed text-ink-strong\">I went from imposter syndrome to real professional confidence. The change held because it came from the inside.</blockquote><figcaption class=\"mt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-wine\">Sarah M.<!-- --> <span class=\"font-normal text-whisper\">· <!-- -->Florida</span></figcaption></figure></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-gradient-to-b from-wine to-wine-dark px-5 py-24 text-center text-cream md:px-8 md:py-28\"><div cl